+"""Tests for Exp 4868 V449 frontier SOTA ingestion.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-ARC-WMTE-4868,
+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-4868-V449-FRONTIER-MAPPED,
+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-4868-NO-FABRICATION.
+"""
